Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.11,0:00:17.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaban, I believed in you...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.83,0:00:19.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.41,0:00:25.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even for Inaba-chan, taking care of this much work is impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.25,0:00:26.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, Iori-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.83,0:00:28.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you're treating me to that fruit-flavoured milk later on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.25,0:00:32.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.25,0:00:34.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I get fruit milk!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.25,0:00:36.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised that they made a bet since it was their fault that Inaba's behind in her work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.88,0:00:36.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.88,0:00:36.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter, as per the usual,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.84,0:00:36.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won so elegantly!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.84,0:00:39.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I really can do just anything if I want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.39,0:00:39.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,he'll soon be in for some heavy punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.56,0:00:42.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won! I won!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.36,0:00:43.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.77,0:00:50.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, you got me into this because of that mess of an article you turned in!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.11,0:00:52.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, I have to bring the work home with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.90,0:00:54.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, you're exactly right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.82,0:00:57.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why you're turning the fruit milk over to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.49,0:00:59.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This has nothing to do with that...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.24,0:00:59.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.83,0:01:01.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.58,0:01:05.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aoki really went overboard with his report this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.29,0:01:08.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He went completely along with his interests to write about lunch recommendations for girls,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.79,0:01:11.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and it's so obvious that he wrote it based on the food I like.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.92,0:01:12.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.92,0:01:18.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The article that I wrote, "Wrestling Technique Debate: Ropework and Camera Work", is obviously superior.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.68,0:01:21.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I picked the wrong person to talk to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.22,0:01:23.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It hurts me if you say that out to me so blankly in real life.{}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.89,0:01:27.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and get ready to leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.48,0:01:29.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll take care of the rest once we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.86,0:01:31.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.95,0:03:08.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Three weeks have passed since the whole personality switching thing ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.66,0:03:11.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagase made a full recovery from her injuries,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.46,0:03:16.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}and now we're busy making up for lost time on the next issue of the CRC News.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.51,0:03:20.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Three weeks ago, I confessed my feelings to Nagase,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.55,0:03:24.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and she acknowledged them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.47,0:03:29.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But with her injuries and the next issue on our minds,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.39,0:03:32.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we haven't had a chance to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.06,0:03:38.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, the Yamaboshi High School Cultural Research Club is back to life as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.33,0:03:44.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or so we thought...\Nuntil school ended the next day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.34,0:03:53.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're already here?\NYou're fast, Inaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.34,0:03:56.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wasn't able to get it done at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.64,0:03:59.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm {\i1}definitely{\i0} finishing this thing today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.39,0:04:01.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Think Yui and Aoki'll be long?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.39,0:04:04.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They need to clarify a few things.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.98,0:04:09.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I ran into them on the way up.\NThey're both on clean-up duty today, so they'll be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.98,0:04:13.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doesn't having to wait on people seriously piss you off?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.86,0:04:16.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not like it's their fault, but still...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.08,0:04:20.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, you can't really complain if it's not their fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.87,0:04:24.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Makes you want to take out your anger on the nearest freak, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.92,0:04:24.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, it doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.17,0:04:27.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What good would that do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.17,0:04:29.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taking it out on someone else relieves stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.21,0:04:31.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that's just mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.47,0:04:36.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I find that making you voice needless observations with a bit of a dark spin to them
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.05,0:04:38.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is a great way of relieving stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.22,0:04:40.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.68,0:04:47.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're relieving your stress by taking it out on me, but without making me feel bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.99,0:04:53.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Inaba?{YEAAAAAHHH}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.71,0:05:00.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaba?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.17,0:05:11.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hold on. What's wrong?\NDoes your back itch or something?{Lol. This fucking guy.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.72,0:05:20.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!\NHey, wait!\NWhat are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.68,0:05:22.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on. Take your clothes off.\NTake my clothes off?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.06,0:05:24.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.06,0:05:27.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't do it if you don't take them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.06,0:05:29.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't do what?{Oh, Shirou...}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.27,0:05:31.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know what you're up to!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.28,0:05:34.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're taking your stress out on me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.75,0:05:43.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-Inaba—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.84,0:05:57.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What in the world are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.47,0:05:57.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.68,0:06:00.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get off! Get {\i1}off{\i0}!\NWait! It's not what it looks like!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.47,0:06:05.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know what it is either, but—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.48,0:06:07.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaba?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.28,0:06:16.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Would you mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.49,0:06:16.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,explaining yourselves right now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.37,0:06:21.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yui?\NWhat's gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.38,0:06:33.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Blood?\NDid I... do this?\NWhy?\NHey, every—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.84,0:06:37.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The table!\NWhat happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.30,0:06:40.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why is it broken?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.31,0:06:43.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yui, you're bleeding!\NLet me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.14,0:06:45.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iori!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.31,0:06:48.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Did it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.23,0:06:49.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.23,0:06:51.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.95,0:07:06.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened to them?\NThat was weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.95,0:07:08.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is this really okay?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.84,0:07:15.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Onii-chan, going out?{No, he's obviously getting ready to go to bed}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.55,0:07:19.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.05,0:07:19.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.80,0:07:22.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,about to go outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.80,0:07:25.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you asking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.43,0:07:29.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.94,0:07:33.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.82,0:07:35.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagase?\NTaichi, tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.94,0:07:38.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are we—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.99,0:07:39.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.99,0:07:43.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Er... Huh?\NWhat's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.29,0:07:46.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did something happen?\NGood...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.20,0:07:48.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.54,0:07:51.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good... evening?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.71,0:07:55.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.71,0:07:58.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know why, but before I knew it, I called you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.63,0:08:01.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I felt like I just had to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.13,0:08:05.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A-Actually, I suddenly wanted to see you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.68,0:08:08.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My body just started acting on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.02,0:08:09.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.60,0:08:13.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going on?\NThis is kind of weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.60,0:08:15.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm curious, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.11,0:08:21.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, you felt like you had to talk to me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.99,0:08:22.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.62,0:08:27.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about you?\NYou wanted to talk to me, right?\NI...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.79,0:08:32.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.84,0:08:36.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,685)}That confession at the hospital—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.63,0:08:41.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We haven't had a chance to talk—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.63,0:08:43.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have your feelings...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.64,0:08:47.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have your feelings changed since then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.81,0:08:50.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.81,0:08:55.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My feelings haven't changed a bit since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.48,0:08:59.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.\NUm...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.24,0:09:02.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.41,0:09:12.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know, I'm feeling {\i1}really{\i0} embarrassed right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.21,0:09:15.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm... feeling it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.96,0:09:18.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,L-Let's leave it at this for today!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.96,0:09:21.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.76,0:09:21.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.26,0:09:23.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll do that.\NSorry to bother you like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.68,0:09:26.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bye!{Dat "Bye!" hnnng}\NWait, Nagase—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.89,0:09:30.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.64,0:09:34.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sh-She's not my girlfriend!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.64,0:09:37.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're blushing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.85,0:09:37.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that's a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.85,0:09:41.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were acting so weird a few weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.11,0:09:44.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were acting the same way just now, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.61,0:09:44.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.86,0:09:46.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're lovesick.\NI'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.74,0:09:53.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, it might be better if you thought that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.33,0:09:56.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Onii-chan, you're so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.00,0:10:02.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, where'd you learn about being lovesick?{He wants to keep Rina pure~}{HNNNGGG It's a big bro's job to protect his precious imouto.}{http://www.batoto.net/comic/_/comics/rika-r257}{I read that. Really good.}{I'm reporting all of you}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.38,0:10:05.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Onii-chan needs to have a nice, long talk with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.32,0:10:24.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-Inaba?!\NYester—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.20,0:10:30.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,U-Um...\NBad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.54,0:10:33.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yui and Aoki were taken into custody.\NHuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.79,0:10:35.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.79,0:10:41.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know the details, but it's being discussed in the faculty room.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.13,0:10:43.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I tried calling them, but they aren't answering.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.13,0:10:45.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They might be at the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.10,0:10:45.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.06,0:10:48.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.06,0:10:51.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why'd they get taken into custody?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.02,0:10:51.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like I'd know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.44,0:10:53.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.44,0:10:56.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does {\i1}anyone{\i0} here know what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.81,0:10:56.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You called?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.73,0:10:58.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.15,0:11:00.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fujishima?\NUm...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.82,0:11:04.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't think anyone called for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.82,0:11:07.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you know something, tell us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.70,0:11:13.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bossing someone around when you're asking for their help, Inaba-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.75,0:11:17.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please tell us, Fujishima-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.75,0:11:19.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.84,0:11:23.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you let me borrow Nagase-san for two hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.84,0:11:24.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.09,0:11:28.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not asking for much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.39,0:11:31.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Nagase-san will enjoy it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.56,0:11:35.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Fujishima, that's dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.52,0:11:36.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't touch her!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.35,0:11:36.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Again?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.03,0:11:45.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey. What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.16,0:11:50.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Yaegashi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.28,0:11:50.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Practicing a dance?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.28,0:11:53.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not really...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.79,0:11:53.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.21,0:11:57.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you'll tell us what happened to Aoki and Yui,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.21,0:12:01.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,then two or three hours is nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.38,0:12:01.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So tell us, Fujishima-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.38,0:12:03.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.55,0:12:05.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I still would've told you even if you didn't take my offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.01,0:12:11.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?!\NMy {\i1}determination{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.31,0:12:14.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, you three look horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.31,0:12:18.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was just trying to lighten the mood with some humor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.60,0:12:21.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't think you'd hate it {\i1}that{\i0} much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.28,0:12:28.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}This morning, some boys from Akitaka High started hitting on a few girls from our school.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.36,0:12:33.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kiriyama-san happened to be there and beat the boys to a pulp.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.29,0:12:35.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it looks like she went a bit too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.96,0:12:39.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The police decided to question her at the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.84,0:12:42.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And then Aoki-kun came out of the crowd, shouting,\N"Where are you taking her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.84,0:12:45.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let go of her!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.84,0:12:48.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It turned into quite the struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.84,0:12:52.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, they were just trying to help out their fellow schoolmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.84,0:12:55.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They'll probably just let them off with a stern warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.64,0:12:56.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You bet they will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.23,0:12:59.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If they even {\i1}think{\i0} of punishing them,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.81,0:13:01.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll use every trick in the book to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.23,0:13:05.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do you know so much about this, Fujishima-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.94,0:13:09.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My dad just happens to be pretty high up in the police department.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.24,0:13:09.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.87,0:13:16.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, how {\i1}very{\i0} nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.66,0:13:16.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll make for a {\i1}very{\i0} useful connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.25,0:13:21.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It {\i1}will{\i0} cost you, but I'll keep it cheap, just for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.17,0:13:25.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're getting along like a house on fire...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.25,0:13:27.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scariest tag team ever...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.43,0:13:32.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So Kiriyama and Aoki never showed up today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.26,0:13:36.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, there's something that's been bothering me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.26,0:13:39.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kiriyama beat up boys from another school, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.48,0:13:40.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't she...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.48,0:13:45.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's been bothering me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.06,0:13:45.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yui's afraid of men.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.90,0:13:48.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's gotten a lot better recently,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.90,0:13:51.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but not to the extent where she can fight men.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.32,0:13:51.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.78,0:13:56.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were acting weird this morning, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.91,0:13:56.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.20,0:14:00.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you hear a voice in your head when that happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.20,0:14:02.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, did you hear one, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.29,0:14:04.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Both of you heard one, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.72,0:14:10.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello. Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.72,0:14:14.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, it hasn't really been that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.26,0:14:16.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.26,0:14:18.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Balloon Vine?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.85,0:14:18.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.68,0:14:25.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As of yesterday, you will be hearing voices in your heads every so often.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.94,0:14:31.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When that happens, your bodies will act on impulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.32,0:14:35.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will you cut this shit out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.57,0:14:35.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are {\i1}not{\i0} guinea pigs!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.87,0:14:40.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, right. I haven't apologized to Nagase-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.62,0:14:47.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm very sorry from around the middle of my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.75,0:14:51.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why not leave us alone if you really feel sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.21,0:14:51.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.47,0:14:55.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've told you several times.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.06,0:14:59.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're all just a little too interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.27,0:15:02.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now I'd like to explain what's happening this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.27,0:15:09.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Simply put, I'm unleashing the desires you hold in your hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.52,0:15:11.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unleashing our desires?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.19,0:15:17.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like I've said before, it'll end when you show me something rather interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.45,0:15:25.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You could say that I'm helping\N you find your true selves.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.38,0:15:28.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"True selves"...\NI have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.38,0:15:31.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is being a shut-in against the rules?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.34,0:15:32.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.51,0:15:37.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're very good at analyzing these situations.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.01,0:15:39.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My answer is, that can be interesting in itself,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.97,0:15:44.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and if it's not, I'll make it interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.39,0:15:46.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's all I can say.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.39,0:15:49.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll make it interesting?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.90,0:15:52.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe I've told you more than I needed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.90,0:15:55.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, until next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.85,0:16:04.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.44,0:16:06.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seriously, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.82,0:16:10.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you two have any strategies for avoiding this phenomenon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.95,0:16:14.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.95,0:16:17.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We managed to get through last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.20,0:16:19.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's just believe in ourselves and we'll\Nmanage to make it through this time as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.83,0:16:23.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, rather, we can do something to make it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.08,0:16:25.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not looking at this optimistically at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.42,0:16:29.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You would've been so cool had you laid that out better.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.84,0:16:30.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.96,0:16:33.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's not just incompetent, but an idiot too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.34,0:16:37.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't laugh at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.76,0:16:40.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.14,0:16:44.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,right now, we can only hope that we can somehow manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.71,0:16:52.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So it's Balloon Vine again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.09,0:16:55.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry to make you worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.51,0:17:00.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No need to apologize.\NWe weren't worried about you in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.64,0:17:03.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's so mean!\NInaba-chan, you're so mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.97,0:17:07.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it's great that they let you off with a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.35,0:17:10.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\NI'm totally okay, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.44,0:17:14.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kiriyama's absent again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.19,0:17:20.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Yui wanted to save those girls,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.49,0:17:20.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,even if it meant hitting those boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.53,0:17:24.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aoki wanted to stop them from taking Yui away,\Neven if it meant fighting the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.29,0:17:26.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your super-ego would usually stop you from doing something so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.96,0:17:29.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But now...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.96,0:17:34.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Your desires get unleashed, and you just can't help yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.50,0:17:39.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's probably why Yui smashed the table two days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.63,0:17:42.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, you got on top of me—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.18,0:17:48.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you {\i1}dare{\i0} talk about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.39,0:17:52.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you no {\i1}decency{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.23,0:17:52.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You {\i1}don't{\i0} bring up bodies people bury!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.61,0:17:55.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should knock you around until you forget!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.78,0:17:58.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um...\NWhat are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.16,0:18:03.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now look what you've done!\NYou idiot! Dumbass! Retard!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.16,0:18:05.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.99,0:18:08.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's nothing important.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.79,0:18:12.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Before you came in two days ago, my desires got unleashed,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.79,0:18:15.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and I... well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.79,0:18:18.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,got on top of Taichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.21,0:18:18.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.63,0:18:21.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I wasn't here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.63,0:18:23.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't get me wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.18,0:18:28.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just happened to come across a dirty picture right before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.81,0:18:32.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I don't know how far I was going to take it,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.56,0:18:35.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I know I wasn't going to cross any lines!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.28,0:18:37.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.99,0:18:39.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've never done it before, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.57,0:18:43.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Back to the issue at hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.57,0:18:48.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}We could manage personality switching just by being careful,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.45,0:18:51.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but it won't work for this "desire unleashing" thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.00,0:18:55.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yui and Aoki have already caused trouble for other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.83,0:19:00.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there's a risk of involving outsiders this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.59,0:19:03.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see two possible ways of dealing with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.22,0:19:07.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}The first is to keep yourself from experiencing any extreme emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.59,0:19:11.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The second is to do everything you want without restraint,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.02,0:19:15.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,living more freely and having more fun than you usually would.\NWhat do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.23,0:19:21.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In other words, we can either empty our minds
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.48,0:19:21.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so we don't have any desires that might cause a problem,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.82,0:19:24.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,or we can do the opposite and keep stress from building
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.82,0:19:27.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,by doing whatever we want every so often.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.12,0:19:32.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Both sound pretty hard to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.33,0:19:37.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're amazing, Inaban!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.75,0:19:37.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You already came up with a plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.75,0:19:39.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Flattery won't get you anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.50,0:19:43.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll need to help each other out, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.84,0:19:46.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh... That could work, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.10,0:19:49.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was it a bad idea?\NNo, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.39,0:19:53.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Helping each other out isn't a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.69,0:19:58.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll have to see what actually happens for anything else.\NWe'll deal with the situations case-by-case.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.65,0:20:00.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's all we can do for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.74,0:20:05.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yui'll probably be back in school tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.74,0:20:07.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can talk more about it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.49,0:20:07.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.20,0:20:11.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We may not know what we need to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.79,0:20:14.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I'm sure it'll all work out if we put our heads together!\NYeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.67,0:20:16.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.67,0:20:20.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you, Taichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.71,0:20:20.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take care of Iori.\NSure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.34,0:20:24.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I can't just take care of Nagase. I'll take—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.80,0:20:28.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iori is the only person you need to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.80,0:20:33.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And Aoki can take care of Yui—\NWait, we can't really count on you.\NDon't underestimate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.93,0:20:36.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll be in for a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.93,0:20:39.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, Inaban, aren't you coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.69,0:20:44.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I still have to work on our newspaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.94,0:20:44.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to get some more stuff done.\NWe can stay and help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.53,0:20:46.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't need to!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.45,0:20:49.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry up! Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.45,0:20:53.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't work if you're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.12,0:20:53.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.14,0:21:11.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did I do it right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.43,0:21:15.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are they going to be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.77,0:21:21.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.61,0:21:30.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taichi, do you have a moment?\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.57,0:21:34.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't usually call this late.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.57,0:21:37.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I have to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.54,0:21:40.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We didn't really get to finish last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.00,0:21:40.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O-Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.50,0:21:43.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.17,0:21:47.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It might not really be a good time to talk about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.17,0:21:51.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I think it's really important, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.77,0:21:56.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can we keep things the way they are?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.64,0:22:00.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The way they are?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.48,0:22:05.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It sounds pretty bad to ask that of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.03,0:22:10.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I want to keep our distance right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.24,0:22:18.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're kind of in a weird situation with this whole "desire unleashing" thing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.79,0:22:18.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.16,0:22:25.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't think it's a good idea to move forward with our relationship in this kind of situation.{she ditched him? what a slut!}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.92,0:22:27.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.17,0:22:27.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.63,0:22:31.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wasn't thinking about that at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.63,0:22:35.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're probably really dangerous right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.89,0:22:37.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're really dangerous, \Nno matter how you look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.52,0:22:40.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't know what we might do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.40,0:22:44.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, could I make a confession of my own?\NA confession?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.82,0:22:51.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I still really don't know much about myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.24,0:22:57.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sometimes, I wonder if it's really okay for me to be like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.24,0:23:02.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So I'm actually a little excited about this desire unleashing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.08,0:23:04.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excited?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.63,0:23:08.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The desires in our hearts are going to be unleashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.63,0:23:13.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I get the feeling I might find out more about who I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.96,0:23:13.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.05,0:23:20.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hate myself for thinking things like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.85,0:23:23.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I can't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.48,0:23:26.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, confession time over!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.81,0:23:26.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks for listening!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.98,0:23:30.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll treat you to a snack or something tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.69,0:23:33.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's another part of who you are.\NWhat?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.99,0:23:41.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, looking at yourself objectively like that is part of who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.08,0:23:47.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think you can see your true self in how you live your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.71,0:23:53.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whenever I'm with you, I feel like everything's going to be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.00,0:23:53.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.09,0:23:56.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.14,0:24:05.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It'll work out.\NI'll make it work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.32,0:24:14.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This time...\NI have to do it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.68,0:24:20.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's strong! She's super cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.70,0:24:19.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!\NShe's cute! She's cheerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.85,0:24:21.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! Don't look!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.85,0:24:21.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.85,0:24:22.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Her hair's pretty! \NShe's tiny! She's pure!{Fades out}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.99,0:24:26.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm that kind of person.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.64,0:24:23.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I made a huge mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.96,0:24:26.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You think {\i1}I'd{\i0} know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.63,0:24:28.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't ask me!\NYou've let me down, Inaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.67,0:24:31.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I never thought you'd turn your back on a friend.
